			"text":"3.8.2026\n- ~~follow up GDI API~~\n- ~~folow up chi Vy~~\n- ~~follow up dan thanh~~\n- ~~follow up trang phan~~\n- ~~follow up Trang Le~~\n- ~~craft email for Madame~~ \n- ",
