			"text":"10.8.2026\n - follow up HR\n - FOLLOW UP INVENTORY REPORTING\n - PREP UP FOR GDI DETAILS \n - PREP UP FOR WFX KNOWLEDGE SHARING\n - PREP UP FOR TECHCOMBANK SHARING\n - PREP UP FOR MEETING - FIN.AI",
