		{
			"id":"c4eb64775c44eb81",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"13.8.2026\n- follow up HR\n- FOLLOW UP EXPENSE INVOICES\n- FOLLOW UP FIN - AI \n- FOLLOW UP RULES BASED ENGINE\n- MEET UP W WFX",
