			"text":"14.8.2026\n- ~~check up stratova~~\n- ~~recheck rule base for fin ai~~ \n- ~~follow up hr~~\n- ~~folllow up expense invoice~~\n- ~~consult on sew - wash~~ \n- ~~meet up gdi - 2:30pm~~\n- ~~check up alloc~~",
