			"text":"sourcing \n-> indent management \n-> re_activate indents\n-> input style ĐÍCH + search\n\t-![[Pasted image 20260814113003.png]]\n- click indent no.\n\t- ![[Pasted image 20260814113111.png]]\n- click adjustedQty.inhouse\n\t- ![[Pasted image 20260814113327.png]]\n-  ALLOCATE TỪNG PO CÓ TRONG STYLE ĐÍCH ",
