		{
			"id":"d230d13443f77359",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"9.9.2026:\n- UPDATE FIN AI RULES \n- ~~FOLLOW UP EXPENSE INVOICES DA NANG - NT~~\n- FOLLOW UP MATERIAL ALLOCATIONS\n- FOLLOW UP GDI \n- ~~FOLLOW UP AWB~~\n- ~~UPDATE AWB OCR~~ \n- QUARTER REVIEW",
