			"text":"10.9.2026\n- ~~FOLLOW UP GDI~~\n- ~~FOLLOW UP MATERIAL ALLOC~~\n- ~~FOLLOW UP ADMIN EXPENSE~~\n- ~~FOLLOW UP AWB.OCR~~\n- ~~FOLLOW UP AWB.MAIL~~\n- FOLLOW UP WORKSTREAM 2 \n- FOLLOW UP WORKSTREAM 3\n- PREP UP DOCS FOR INTERNS \n- ~~PREP UP DOCS FOR INVOICES~~\n- PREP UP PPJ ESL HO \n- PREP UP HAPPYDAYS IELTS \n",
