			"text":"14.9.2026\n   \n- FOLLOW UP GDI\n- FOLLOW UP MATERIAL ALLOC\n- FOLLOW UP ADMIN EXPENSE\n- ~~FOLLOW UP AWB.OCR~~\n- ~~FOLLOW UP AWB.MAIL~~\n- ~~FOLLOW UP WORKSTREAM 2~~ \n- ~~FOLLOW UP WORKSTREAM 3~~\n- ~~follow p WALL NEWS WITH MRS JESSICA~~\n",
