		{
			"id":"77589d7953284f78",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### PPJ Group x Wizcore AI – Meeting Recap & Next Actions\n\n| #     | Topic / Action Item                                   | Summary / Expected Outcome                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             | Owner / Next Step                                                                                                    |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **1** | **Onsite Meeting at PPJ Head Office**                 | **Time:** 09:15 AM, Thursday, **17 September 2026**. **Location:** PPJ Group Head Office – **48 Tăng Nhơn Phú, Phường Tăng Nhơn Phú, Ho Chi Minh City**. <br><br>Purpose: deeper discussion on PPJ manufacturing challenges and potential Smart Factory / AI solutions.                                                                                | **PPJ + Wizcore**                                                                                                    |\n| **2** | **PPJ Manufacturing Pain Points**                     | PPJ operates across **textile, garment, and wash manufacturing**, including knitwear, outerwear, casualwear, formalwear denim/jeans washing. <br><br>Current challenges include fragmented production data, significant manual work, manual data entry/consolidation, limited machine connectivity, and reliance on manual operational monitoring.<br> | PPJ to provide business/process context. Wizcore to assess potential solutions.                                      |\n| **3** | **Smart Factory & IoT – End-to-End Solution**         | PPJ is looking beyond individual sensors/devices. We need a partner capable of supporting the **full package:** <br>factory assessment → machine connectivity / IoT → data acquisition → system integration → centralized data → monitoring/dashboard → reporting → analytics/AI.                                                                      | **Wizcore** to introduce relevant capabilities, architecture, devices, and implementation approach.                  |\n| **4** | **Factory Data & System Integration**                 | Assess what production/machine data can be collected, which data is actually valuable, and how it can connect with PPJ’s existing systems/data platforms through **IoT gateway, machine interface, API, database, edge or other integration methods**.                                                                                                 | **PPJ + Wizcore Technical Team** to assess onsite and identify potential pilot scope.                                |\n| **5** | **Monitoring, Dashboard & Automated Reporting**       | PPJ needs to reduce manual Excel/report consolidation and establish centralized monitoring for production status, productivity, downtime, quality, abnormalities and management KPIs. <br><br>Target flow: **Machine/System Data → Centralized Data → KPI → Dashboard / Automated Report / Alert**.                                                    | Wizcore to advise suitable monitoring and reporting architecture.                                                    |\n| **6** | **Traceability, Quality & Intelligent Manufacturing** | Explore **material traceability, production traceability, quality monitoring, anomaly detection and defect prevention**. <br><br>Historical manufacturing data may be accumulated over time to enable deeper analytics and predictive/preventive use cases.                                                                                            | **Wizcore** to provide relevant manufacturing use cases, especially for textile, garment and wash operations.        |\n| **7** | **Internal AI Chatbot / Knowledge Assistant**         | PPJ is also interested in an internal AI solution that can securely retrieve and answer questions from approved **documents, SOPs, manufacturing knowledge, business data and internal systems**. <br><br>Key areas to discuss: RAG/knowledge retrieval, system/data integration, permission control, deployment model and security.                   | Wizcore to arrange **AI/Data technical specialists** for discussion.                                                 |\n| **8** | **Expected Outcome & POC Direction**                  | The onsite session should identify **Process → Pain Point → Machine/System → Required Data → Connectivity → Automation/AI Use Case → Business Value → POC Scope**. <br><br>PPJ prefers to start with a focused, measurable POC before considering factory-wide rollout.                                                                                | **PPJ + Wizcore** to agree on priority use case(s), required data, technical feasibility and next-step POC proposal. |\n\n**Main expectation from PPJ:**  \nWe are looking for Wizcore’s **consulting, solution design and implementation capability** for smart manufacturing across **Textile – Garment – Wash factories**, rather than only purchasing individual IoT devices or standalone AI solutions.",
